- this is still a very small code change, much safer than altering base-model training.

If you want one extra easy robustness trick, average two meta-model outputs:
- meta model 1: logistic regression on `[p1, p2]`
- meta model 2: logistic regression on `[p1, p2, p_mean, p_diff]`
- final meta probability = average of the two meta OOF/test predictions
